  "title": "The Opportunity Agenda - Jenifer Rajkumar for New York — Jenifer Rajkumar for New York",
  "full_text": "0\n\nSkip to Content\n\nHome\n\nMeet Jenifer\n\nThe Opportunity Agenda\n\nNews\n\nEndorsements\n\nGet Involved\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nDONATE\n\nOpen Menu Close Menu\n\nOpen Menu Close Menu\n\nHome\n\nMeet Jenifer\n\nThe Opportunity Agenda\n\nNews\n\nEndorsements\n\nGet Involved\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nDONATE\n\nHome\n\nMeet Jenifer\n\nThe Opportunity Agenda\n\nNews\n\nEndorsements\n\nGet Involved\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nDONATE\n\nThe Opportunity Agenda\n\nNew York has always been the place where dreamers come to build a future. But today too many New Yorkers feel like no matter how hard they work, they can’t get ahead. Jenifer is living testament that the American Dream is alive and possible, and she’s committed to a life of service to restore the promise of opportunity — so that every New Yorker has a real shot at success . As the daughter of immigrants, trailblazing civil rights attorney, and first South Asian woman ever elected to office in State history, she will create opportunities for every New Yorker—so that more dreams are realized in our city and state.\n\nProtecting Our Freedoms and Defending Equality\n\nAs a civil rights lawyer with a proven track record, Jenifer will fight for the rights and dignity of everyone, in New York and across the country.\n\nLearn More →\n\nAffordability for All\n\nThe daughter of hardworking immigrants as your Assemblywoman, Jenifer will fight for and pave the way for all New Yorkers to have truly affordable housing, economic empowerment, and a dignified standard of living.\n\nLearn More →\n\nA City for All: Ensuring Quality of Life in All Five Boroughs\n\nJenifer has a comprehensive plan to address the many concerns facing New Yorkers, creating a safer, cleaner, fairer City that uplifts everyone.\n\nLearn More →\n\nTransit for All: Expand Public Transit and Fix Our Roadways\n\nAs your Assemblywoman, Jenifer will fight to make our subways and buses cleaner, safer, and accessible and ease traffic in our neighborhoods.\n\nLearn More →\n\nHOME\n\nMEET JENIFER\n\nTHE OPPORTUNITY AGENDA\n\nNEWS\n\nENDORSEMENTS\n\nGET INVOLVED\n\nDONATE\n\n©2026 COPYRIGHT. PAID FOR BY JENIFER RAJKUMAR FOR NEW YORK. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.\n\nCONTACT\n\n(917) 690-0891\n\nJRK4NY@gmail.com",
